        <activityName xml:lang="en">Weeving, bast fibres</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Weeving, bast fibres
Inventory refers to the weeving of 1 kg  yarn into textile, the production of the yarn itself is not included.;
UUID: 3208d237-7666-3858-a8fb-ae8a951bcc92
The inventories include energy consumption, transports and infrastructure for the weeving of bast fibres into a textile.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Weeving was cosidered for the textile production in the present study.
Time period: undefined
Production volume:  
Sampling: Data are from expert interviews about hessian production and  literature.  
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3208d237-7666-3858-a8fb-ae8a951bcc92.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
